        "两边际概率均为1/2，乘积为1/4。",
        "0不等于1/4，所以不满足独立的定义。"
      ],
      "answer": "互斥但不独立。",
      "family_id": "probability.independence-vs-exclusive",
      "variant_id": "independent_events:example-3",
